    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qw56](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qw56) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Sep 14 2025 17km E of Udalguri. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 26.761 longitude 92.2473. It impacted 1839955 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
